{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15263","headline":"折杨柳 · 李端","name":"折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东城攀柳叶，柳叶低着草。\n少壮莫轻年，轻年有衰老。\n柳发遍川冈，登高堪断肠。\n雨烟轻漠漠，何树近君乡。\n赠君折杨柳，颜色岂能久。\n上客莫沾巾，佳人正回首。\n新柳送君行，古柳伤君情。\n突兀临荒渡，婆娑出旧营。\n隋家两岸尽，陶宅五株荣。\n日暮偏愁望，春山有鸟声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}